    C*
     C                   dow       *in54 = *off
    C*
     C                   clear                   pdd01
     C                   clear                   pdh01
     C                   clear                   pdd01
     C                   clear                   pdu01
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
