     C                   eval      kkdseq = cadseq
    C*
     C                   if        eobtyp = 'N'
     C                             and carcfl = 'Y'
    C*
    C* Chain out to the Physician Bill Detail file
    C*
     C     dhky          chain     pdh01                              60
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C                   move      dhprcd        cacpt4
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   move      dhprcd        xxcpt4
    C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   exsr      pmodld
     C*** END ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   movel     'P'           catype
    C*
     C                   exsr      recu
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
     C                   if        eobtyp = 'N'
     C                             and carcfl = 'C'
    C*
    C* Else - treat line item as a procedure code from the CPT4 file
    C*
    C* Chain out to the Physician Bill Detail file
     C     dhky          chain     pdh01                              60
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C                   move      dhprcd        cacpt4
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   move      dhprcd        xxcpt4
    C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   exsr      pmodld
     C*** END ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   movel     'P'           catype
    C*
     C                   exsr      proc
     C                   else
    C*
    C* Else treat line item as a dental code
    C* Chain out to the Dental Bill Detail file
     C                   if        eobtyp = 'D'
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                             and carcfl = 'C'
    C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
