     C                   clear                   pcawk2
     C*** END ADD *** 10/02/03 ****************************************
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
    C* Release the record lock
     C                   except    rca01
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
    C* Release the record lock
     C                   except    rca01
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
