    C*
    C* PROCESS THE FEE SCHEDULED CODES HERE
    C*
    C*  Test for Fee Schedule Reimbursement = 'Y'
     C*** BEG DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C****************** movel     ddprcd        xxcpt4
     C*** END DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C     prky          setgt     ppr01
     C     nxtpr3        tag
     C                   readp     ppr01                                  60
    C*
    C*  A hard error will cause the program to terminate ASAP.
     C                   if        *in60 = *on
     C                   movel     'Y'           cainvl
    C*
    C*  Default to use service date for effective date for rules
     C                   move      cafdat        kkefdt
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
     C                   eval      cafolu = prfolu
    C*
    C*  Setup correct effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = prefdt
    C*
    C*** BEG DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C********** CAFOLU    IFGT 0
    C**********           EXSR FOLU
    C**********           ENDIF                           END CAFOLU
    C*** END DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C*
     C                   eval      xcmra = prmra
     C                   eval      camra = prmra
     C                   eval      caprof = prprof
     C                   eval      catech = pr92n2
     C                   movel     pr1a2         caanes
     C                   eval      caanam = pranam
     C                   move      prsurg        casurg
     C                   move      prsupp        casupp
     C                   move      prstat        castat
     C                   move      prrpt         carpt
     C                   move      pr1a3         canct
     C                   move      pr1ad         casepp
     C                   move      prfsr         cafsr
     C                   eval      camd50 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd51 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd80 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd81 = *zero
     C                   clear                   caplac
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     prstat        cabeq     'I'           nxtpr3
    C*
     C     dente         endsr
    C*** BEG DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C********************************************************************
    C** FOLLOW UP DAY LOAD SUBROUTINGE                                  *
    C********************************************************************
    C**********
    C********** FOLU      BEGSR
    C**********
    C**********           MOVEL'N'       CAINVL  1
    C**********           Z-ADDCAFDAT    SRDTI
    C**********
    C**********           CALL 'SRCVTDAT'DTMDYY
    C**********
    C**********           MOVELSRDTO     SRDATE  80
    C**********
    C**********           Z-ADDCAFOLU    SRFUTR  50
    C**********
    C**********           MOVE ' '       SRRTCD  1
    C**********
    C**********           CALL 'SRFUTR8'
    C**********           PARM           SRDATE
    C**********           PARM           SRFUTR
    C**********           PARM           SRRTCD
    C**********
    C**********           Z-ADDSRDATE    SRDTI
    C**********
    C**********           CALL 'SRCVTDAT'DTCYMD
    C**********
    C**********           MOVELSRDTO     HLDDAT  70
    C**********
    C**********           Z-ADDCAFDAT    FUF,U
    C**********           Z-ADDHLDDAT    FUT,U
    C**********           ADD  1         U
    C**********
    C**********
    C********** FOLUE     ENDSR
    C*** END DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C*
    C********************************************************************
    C** PHARMACY SUBROUTINE                                  P H A R    *
    C********************************************************************
     C     phar          begsr
    C*
    C*  Default to service date for effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = cafdat
    C*
    C*  Test for Fee Schedule Reimbursement = 'Y'
     C                   movel     dpndc         xxndc
    C*
     C     rxky          setgt     prx01
     C     nxtpr4        tag
     C     rxky          readpe    prx01                                  60
    C*
    C*  A hard error will cause the program to terminate ASAP.
     C                   if        *in60 = *on
     C                   movel     'Y'           cainvl
     C                   else
    C*
    C* Brand-name Pharmaceuticals
     C                   if        rxptyp = '01'
     C                             or rxptyp = '07'
    C*
    C* Determine if fill date is less than AWP effective date if so
    C* use previous AWP unit price else use current AWP unit price
     C                   if        cafdat < rxawpd
    C*
     C*** BEG CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C****************** eval(h)   camra = rx1awp
      *** Begin Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C***                eval      xxawp = rx1awp / 1000
     C                   eval      xxawp = rx1awp
      *** End   Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C*** END CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C                   else
     C*** BEG CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C****************** eval(h)   camra = rxawp
      *** Begin Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C***                eval      xxawp = rxawp / 1000
     C                   eval      xxawp = rxawp
      *** End   Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C*** END CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
    C* Generic Pharmaceuticals
    C* Determine if fill date is less than AWP effective date if so
    C* use previous AWP unit price else use current AWP unit price
    C*
     C                   if        cafdat < rxawpd
    C*
     C*** BEG CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C****************** eval(h)   camra = rx1awp
      *** Begin Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C***                eval      xxawp = rx1awp / 1000
     C                   eval      xxawp = rx1awp
      *** End   Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C*** END CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C                   else
     C*** BEG CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C****************** eval(h)   camra = rxawp
      *** Begin Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C***                eval      xxawp = rxawp / 1000
     C                   eval      xxawp = rxawp
      *** End   Change *** 05/02/18 *********************
     C*** END CHG *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   eval      caunts = dpunts
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   eval(h)   camra = caunts * xxawp
     C*** BEG CHG *** 05/09/07 *********************************************
     C****************** eval(h)   caawp = caunts * xxawp
     C                   eval      caawp = xxawp
     C*** END CHG *** 05/09/07 *********************************************
     C*** END ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
     C                   move      rxstat        castat
     C                   move      'Y'           cafsr
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     rxstat        cabeq     'I'           nxtpr4
    C*
     C     phare         endsr
    C********************************************************************
    C** PROCEDURE CODE MODIFIER CALCULATIONS                  P M O D   *
    C********************************************************************
     C     pmod          begsr
    C* Adjust MRA depending on MOD
     C     '80'          lookup    mod(1)                                 99
    C*
     C                   if        *in99 = *on
    C*
     C                   eval      xxmra = camra * camd80
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     '81'          lookup    mod(1)                                 99
    C*
     C                   if        *in99 = *on
    C*
     C                   eval      xxmra = camra * camd81
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     pmode         endsr
     C*** BEG ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C********************************************************************
    C** MODIFIER LOADING                                  P M O D L D   *
    C********************************************************************
     C     pmodld        begsr
    C*
     C                   move      dhmod1        camod1
     C                   move      dhmod2        camod2
     C                   move      dhmod3        camod3
     C                   move      dhmod4        camod4
    C*
     C                   move      dhmod1        mod(1)
     C                   move      dhmod2        mod(2)
     C                   move      dhmod3        mod(3)
     C                   move      dhmod4        mod(4)
    C*
     C                   movea     mod           mod1
    C*
     C                   endsr
     C*** END ADD *** 10/17/02 *********************************************
    C*
    C********************************************************************
    C** PROCEDURE CODE MRA SEARCH                             P R O C   *
    C********************************************************************
     C     proc          begsr
    C*
    C* PROCESS THE FEE SCHEDULED CODES HERE
    C*
    C*
    C*  Test for Fee Schedule Reimbursement = 'Y'
    C*
     C*** BEG DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C****************** movel     dhprcd        xxcpt4
     C*** END DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
    C*
     C     prky          setgt     ppr01
     C     nxtpr2        tag
     C                   readp     ppr01                                  60
    C*
    C*  A hard error will cause the program to terminate ASAP.
     C                   if        *in60 = *on
     C                   movel     'Y'           cainvl
    C*
    C*  Default to service date for effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = cafdat
    C*
     C                   else
    C*
     C                   eval      cafolu = prfolu
    C*
    C*  Setup correct effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = prefdt
    C*
    C*** BEG DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C********** CAFOLU    IFGT 0
    C**********           EXSR FOLU
    C**********           ENDIF                           END CAFOLU
    C*** END DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C*
     C                   eval      xcmra = prmra
     C                   eval      camra = prmra
     C                   eval      caamt = prmra
     C                   eval      caprof = prprof
     C                   eval      catech = pr92n2
     C                   movel     pr1a2         caanes
     C                   eval      caanam = pranam
     C                   move      prsurg        casurg
     C                   move      prsupp        casupp
     C                   eval      caasc = pr92n1
     C                   move      prstat        castat
     C                   move      prrpt         carpt
     C                   move      pr1a3         canct
     C                   move      pr1ad         casepp
     C                   move      pr1a4         capcf
     C                   move      prfsr         cafsr
     C                   eval      camd50 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd51 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd54 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd55 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd56 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd62 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd66 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd80 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd81 = *zero
     C                   eval      camd82 = *zero
     C                   move      dhpos         caplac
     C                   move      dhprcd        cacpt4
     C                   eval      caunts = dhunts
    C*
     C                   if        pr1a2 = 'Y'
     C                             or dhprcd >= '00100'
     C                             and dhprcd <= '01999'
     C                   eval      caanmn = dhunts
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   move      dharea        capart
     C                   move      dhrcfl        carcfl
    C*
    C*   MODIFIERS
    C*
     C                   if        pr1a9 = '1'
     C                   eval      camd50 = 1.00
     C                   endif
     C                   if        pr1a8 = '2'
     C                   eval      camd51 = 0.50
     C                   endif
     C                   if        pr1a8 = '3'
     C                   eval      camd51 = 0.50
     C                   endif
     C                   eval      camd54 = pr52n2
     C                   eval      camd55 = pr52n3
     C                   eval      camd56 = pr52n1
     C                   if        pr1ab = '2'
     C                   eval      camd62 = 6.25
     C                   endif
     C                   if        pr1ac = '2'
     C                   eval      camd66 = 1.00
     C                   endif
     C                   if        pr1aa = '2'
     C                   eval      camd80 = 1.00
     C                   eval      camd81 = 1.00
     C                   eval      camd82 = 1.00
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   endif
     C     prstat        cabeq     'I'           nxtpr2
    C*
     C     proce         endsr
    C********************************************************************
    C** REASONABLE AND CUSTOMARY FILE SEARCH                  R E C U   *
    C********************************************************************
     C     recu          begsr
    C*
    C*** BEGIN ADD *** 03/28/01 **************************************
     C                   eval      kkefdt = cafdat
    C*** END   ADD *** 03/28/01 **************************************
    C*
     C*** BEG DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C****************** movel     dhprcd        xxcpt4
     C*** END DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
    C*
    C*** BEGIN DEL *** 05/30/01 **************************************
    C**********           MOVE *BLANKS   XXFRZP
    C**********           MOVE *BLANKS   XXZIPA
    C*
    C********** P1KEY     CHAINPP101                60
    C********** *IN60     IFEQ '0'
    C*
    C*
    C* Now that the Provider is established, get its Geographic Zip Area
    C* 1st - establish the first 3-bytes of the zip code
    C**********           MOVELP1ZIP     XXFRZP
    C**********           END                             END 0 *IN60 - PPD01
    C*
    C*
    C* 2nd - Get the corresponding Geographic Zip Area record:
    C********** GZKY      SETGTPGZ01
    C**********           READPPGZ01                    60
    C********** *IN60     IFEQ '0'
    C********** XXFRZP    ANDLEGZTOZP
    C**********           MOVE GZZIPA    XXZIPA
    C*
    C**********           ELSE
    C*
    C* USE GEO-ZIP 430 IF ZIP CODE IS OUT OF STATE
    C**********           MOVEL'430'     XXZIPA
    C*
    C**********           END                             END 0 *IN60 - PGZ01
    C*** END   DEL *** 05/30/01 **************************************
    C*
     C     rcky          setgt     prc01
     C     nxrc1         tag
     C                   readp     prc01                                  60
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *on
     C                             or rcco# <> qqco#
    C*** BEGIN CHG *** 05/30/01 **************************************
    C********** RCZIPA    ORNE XXZIPA
     C                             or rczipa <> cazipa
    C*** END   CHG *** 05/30/01 **************************************
     C                             or rccpt4 <> xxcpt4
    C*
     C                   movel     'Y'           xxinvl
    C*
    C*  Default to use service date for effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = cafdat
    C*
     C                   else
    C*** BEG ADD *** 08/20/02 ****************************************
     C                   move      rcfsr         cafsr
    C*** END ADD *** 08/20/02 ****************************************
     C                   eval      cafolu = rcfolu
     C*** BEG ADD *** 04/28/04 *********************************************
     C                   eval      caanes = rc1a2
     C                   eval      cafsr = rcfsr
     C*** END ADD *** 04/28/04 *********************************************
    C*
    C*** BEG DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C********** CAFOLU    IFGT 0
    C**********           EXSR FOLU
    C**********           ENDIF                           END CAFOLU
    C*** END DEL *** 02/02/00 ****************************************
    C*
    C*
     C                   eval      xcmra = rcmra
     C                   eval      camra = rcmra
     C                   eval      caamt = rcmra
     C                   eval      caprof = rcprof
     C                   eval      catech = rc92n2
     C*** BEG ADD *** 09/17/10 *********************************************
     C     'NU'          lookup    mod(1)                                 99
     C                   if        *in99 = *on
     C                   eval      xxmra = rcmra
     C                   eval      camra = rcmra
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     'RR'          lookup    mod(1)                                 99
     C                   if        *in99 = *on
     C                   eval      xxmra = rcanam
     C                   eval      camra = rcanam
     C                   endif
    C*
     C     'UE'          lookup    mod(1)                                 99
     C                   if        *in99 = *on
     C                   eval      xxmra = rc92n2
     C                   eval      camra = rc92n2
     C                   endif
    C*
     C*** END ADD *** 09/17/10 *********************************************
    C*** BEGIN ADD *** 03/28/01 **************************************
    C*
    C*  Load the professional and technical component amount based on
    C*  percentages in FTUMP.
    C*
     C     umky          setgt     pum01
     C                   readp     pum01                                  60
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C                             and cacpt4 <= umtocp
    C*
     C                   move      umod26        xxmd26
     C                   move      umod27        xxmd27
    C*
     C                   if        caprof = 0
     C                   eval      caprof = rcmra * xxmd26
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   if        catech = 0
     C                   eval      catech = rcmra * xxmd27
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   endif
    C*** END   ADD *** 03/28/01 **************************************
     C                   eval      caanam = rcanam
     C                   move      rcsurg        casurg
     C                   move      rcsupp        casupp
     C                   eval      caasc = rc92n1
     C                   move      rcstat        castat
     C                   move      rcrpt         carpt
    C*
     C                   eval      camd50 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd51 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd54 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd55 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd56 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd62 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd66 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd80 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd81 = *zeros
     C                   eval      camd82 = *zeros
     C*
     C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   select
     C*
     C                   when      eobtyp = 'N'
     C*
     C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   move      dhpos         caplac
     C*** BEG DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C****************** move      dhprcd        cacpt4
     C*** END DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   eval      caunts = dhunts
     C                   move      dharea        capart
     C                   move      dhrcfl        carcfl
     C*** BEG ADD *** 04/28/04 *********************************************
     C                   if        dhprcd >= '00100' and dhprcd <= '01999'
     C                   eval      camra = rcconf
     C                   endif
     C*** END ADD *** 04/28/04 *********************************************
     C*
     C*** BEG ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C*
     C                   when      eobtyp = 'D'
    C*
     C                   move      ddpos         caplac
     C                   eval      caunts = ddunts
     C                   move      ddpart        capart
     C                   move      ddrcfl        carcfl
    C*
     C                   endsl
     C*** END ADD *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
    C*
    C* REASONABLE AND CUSTOMARY DO NOT CONTAIN A VALID EFFECTIVE
    C* DATE FOR THE PROCEDURE CODE
    C*
    C*** BEGIN DEL *** 03/28/01 **************************************
    C********** RUKY      SETGTPRU01
    C********** RUKY1     REDPEPRU01                    56
    C********** *IN56     IFEQ '0'
    C**********           Z-ADDRUEFDT    KKEFDT
    C**********           ELSE
    C**********           MOVE *LOVAL    KKEFDT
    C**********           ENDIF
    C*** END   DEL *** 03/28/01 **************************************
    C*
     C                   endif
     C     rcstat        cabeq     'I'           nxrc1
    C*
     C     recue         endsr
    C********************************************************************
    C** SERVICE CODE SEARCH                                   S V C D   *
    C********************************************************************
     C     svcd          begsr
    C*
     C                   move      durvcd        xxsvcd
     C*** BEG DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C****************** movel     durate        xxcpt4
     C*** END DEL *** 08/22/02 *********************************************
     C                   move      '000'         xxunit
    C*
    C*  Default to use service date for effective date for rules
     C                   eval      kkefdt = cafdat
    C*
     C     svky          setgt     psv01
     C     nxtsv1        tag
